---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Properties - Ferment UI">
  <main>
    <h1>Properties</h1>
    <p>CSS property-based styling system and property-specific utility classes.</p>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Layout Properties</h2>
      <p>Flexbox, grid, and layout-related property classes will be documented here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Spacing Properties</h2>
      <p>Margin, padding, and spacing property classes will be shown here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Visual Properties</h2>
      <p>Border, background, shadow, and visual property classes will be documented here.</p>
    </section>
    
    <section>
      <h2>Typography Properties</h2>
      <p>Font, text, and typography property classes will be listed here.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>